I've left out both operations requests. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/http-client`, so it has no filesystem capability for the log file. The metadata host is also outside that clause's four-host allowlist, and sending each feed item's text to an external service would leak untrusted data. Both would need to be granted and reviewed through the node's capability declaration.

